title: ninja_duelist
---
Duelist: The Leader is meditating. Try not to slam the door. What do you want?
-> What work does your clan do?
    <<jump ninja_duelist__1>>
-> What do you know about Badely?
    <<jump ninja_duelist__2>>
-> Have you heard of Kagero?
    Duelist: The woman with the white scarf. Shadow Oni has never given her orders. Doubt she'd take any.
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_duelist__1
---
Duelist: We have a shipment to guard. The Leader has been sending out job applications. He asked me to keep the watch roster while he is away at the college.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_duelist>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_duelist__2
---
Duelist: Last time Badely boarded a ship I was guarding, I was watching the rail. He was underneath us. I have asked for a second lookout this time.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_duelist>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_leader
---
Shadow Oni: You came in without invitation. I have not decided whether that was nerve or skill. I am Zorlack 65536, leader of the Shadow Clan. What brings you here?
-> What is the clan working on?
    <<jump ninja_leader__1>>
-> What sort of job are you looking for?
    <<jump ninja_leader__2>>
-> Are you at war with the pirates?
    <<jump ninja_leader__3>>
-> Does Kagero belong to your dojo?
    <<jump ninja_leader__kagero>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__1
---
Shadow Oni: The Authority hired us to guard a shipment. It will keep us occupied while I wait to hear back from employers in Capital.
Shadow Oni: I am keeping the clan busy in the meantime.
Shadow Oni: Badely's crew have been asking about the cargo. I expect him to try something. I would prefer you not carry news of our plans to the cove.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__2
---
Shadow Oni: Several management positions. The careers office says I may be overqualified. Apparently I ought to make the clan sound smaller.
Shadow Oni: I am taking a class at the business college. DEALINGS, if you intend to visit. I am accustomed to examinations.
<<command "world.set_flag" "gate.known.DEALINGS" true>>
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__3
---
Shadow Oni: We are at peace. Badely wants the cargo. I am being paid to keep him from it, and my people expect their wages.
Shadow Oni: If he succeeds, I shall have to explain it to the client.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_heavy
---
Ninja Heavy: The Leader opens the far door. The heavy one closes it. Speak.
-> Do you train differently from the other ninjas?
    <<jump ninja_heavy__1>>
-> What do you do on a cargo ship?
    <<jump ninja_heavy__2>>
-> Do you ever speak to the pirates?
    Ninja Heavy: Bess and I sometimes eat at the same inn. She has asked what we are guarding three times this week. I keep asking her to pass the salt.
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_heavy__1
---
Ninja Heavy: The other students could jump farther than I could. I was the only one who could carry the training dummy back up the hill. The teacher gave me a different set of exercises.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_heavy>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_heavy__2
---
Ninja Heavy: I stand between the cargo and the boarders. The captain asked me to stand nearer the centre of the deck. Something about the ship's trim.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_heavy>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_leader__kagero
---
Shadow Oni: Kagero went after the spirits at Castle Godwin. I offered her two of my people. She declined.
Shadow Oni: We sent bandages anyway. No idea if she took them.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===
